{
  "issues": [
    {
      "criterion_id": "AC-6",
      "type": "untestable",
      "description": "The phrase 'The fs::remove_file call retains a full.exists() guard' prescribes an implementation mechanism (a guard in source), not an observable behavior. A conformance test cannot assert that a specific guard is present without inspecting or mocking the filesystem implementation. The observable behavior is already covered by AC-9: no error is raised and the path appears in staged.",
