      "suggested_fix": "Change the fixture to `{\"name\":\"wrong-type\",\"napi\":{\"targets\":\"aarch64-apple-darwin\"}}`. Also add the two sibling AC-010c cases the spec names but no task covers end-to-end: a `[tool.maturin].targets` that is a bare string, and an `engines.node`/`requires-python` that is a number — all three with a valid name field."
