      "description": "AC-014 enumerates five platform families whose abi must serialize as JSON null — darwin, freebsd, android, wasi/unknown-with-wasm32-arch — plus win32 targets ('never \"msvc\"'). Only darwin is asserted (T05, T15) and only linux is asserted for the non-null case. freebsd, android, wasi, unknown, and win32 have no abi assertion anywhere in the plan, and win32 is called out by name in the criterion.",
      "suggested_fix": "Extend T05's `build_platform_target_combines_role_and_ci_table` into a table-driven test over one representative triple per family — x86_64-pc-windows-msvc, x86_64-unknown-freebsd, aarch64-linux-android, wasm32-wasip1, wasm32-unknown-unknown — asserting `t.abi == None` for each, alongside the existing darwin and linux cases."
